aa-headunit (0.1.0-2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Wired Android Auto session (USB accessory transition, TLS handshake,
    service discovery, video/audio/touch/microphone) real-hardware-
    confirmed through Milestone 4.
  * Milestone 5 in progress: dedicated unprivileged system user,
    persistent display/rotation/audio/microphone/night-mode settings,
    USB auto-discovery and reconnect loop, appliance preflight checks,
    documented recovery path, and bounded persistent journald logging.
  * Appliance kiosk boot (cage/systemd) written and packaged but not yet
    enabled by default — real-hardware testing found it can hang the
    board; see docs/development/appliance-recovery.md.

